# Roadmap item 81 (0.1), split in the post-implementation review (R1):
# packaging/build_dmg.py writes real build-local content (git SHA/
# describe, UTC timestamp) to this generated module just before a real
# .dmg build. `src/seeker/_build_info.py` is tracked and imports this
# module, falling back to "dev" when it's absent — that tracked file is
# NEVER itself written to, so there is nothing there for a stray build
# to dirty or a careless commit to sweep in.
src/seeker/_build_info_generated.py
